# Configuration

Every field of `xmpl100::Config`, the presets, and the optional Kconfig layer.

| Field | Default | Range |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `channel` | 0 | The port's ADC channels |
| `offset_mv` | 500 | up to 1750 |
| `slope_uv_per_c` | 10000 | 1 or more |
| `samples` | 4 | 1 to 64 |
| `sample_interval_us` | 100 | any |

| Preset | What it sets |
| --- | --- |
| `FastPreset()` | One conversion per reading |
| `LowNoisePreset()` | 32 conversions, 200 µs apart |

